      },
      "text": "NUTRIENTS (N, P, Si)\n       |\n       v (bottom-up)\n  PHYTOPLANKTON + PERIPHYTON\n       |\n       v\n  ZOOPLANKTON (Daphnia, copepods, rotifers)  <-- KEY INTERMEDIATE\n       |                                          (controls algal biomass\n       v                                           AND is controlled by fish)\n  PLANKTIVOROUS FISH (bluegill, roach, ciscoes, shad)\n       |\n       v (top-down)\n  PISCIVOROUS FISH (largemouth bass, pike, walleye, trout)\n       |\n       v\n  APEX PREDATORS (otters, ospreys, herons, humans)"
    },
