      "text": "KEY RESULTS:\n  1. Top predator (bass) controls water clarity through 3-level cascade\n  2. Effect transmitted through 4 trophic levels\n  3. Magnitude: ~200% change in Secchi depth with no nutrient change\n  4. The cascade is \"strong\" in lake systems (P limited, closed basin)\n```"
